(7439349, 1176284, 63218, '<td valign="top">The leaping child has temporarily severed earthly ties, &amp; seems higher with the child leaping out of the frame. Lots of joyful energy in this. I like it that you chose your severed by how you framed the shot, &amp; that there is a seconded level of severed in the subject &amp; that it''s not a literal interpretation. I like your choice of PP, too. Good job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-03-02 09:16:05.</i></td>', 'The leaping child has temporarily severed earthly ties, & seems higher with the child leaping out of the frame. Lots of joyful energy in this. I like it that you chose your severed by how you framed the shot, & that there is a seconded level of severed in the subject & that it''s not a literal interpretation. I like your choice of PP, too. Good job!', '2016-02-24 11:36:08.000000', '2016-03-02 09:16:05.000000', 1),
